OL,3,GNEWSAMan gets suspended sentence over
OL,4,ADalton Mills arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was 15 when an arson attack
OL,7,Fcaused #15m of damage to the historic
OL,8,FDalton Mills complex in Keighley has
OL,9,Fbeen given a suspended sentence.
OL,11,FMcKenzie Mottram, now 20, was sentenced
OL,12,Fat Bradford Crown Court for his role in
OL,13,Fthe blaze, which destroyed the Genappe
OL,14,FMill building on 3 March 2022.
OL,16,FThe Grade II* listed site, which had
OL,17,Fbeen used as a filming location for
OL,18,Ftelevision dramas including Peaky
OL,19,FBlinders and Downton Abbey, was badly
OL,20,Fdamaged in the fire.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
