OL,3,GNEWSAMan gets suspended sentence over
OL,4,ADalton Mills arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Jonathan Robinson sentenced
OL,7,FMottram to 18 months' detention,
OL,8,Fsuspended for two years, and ordered
OL,9,Fhim to complete 200 hours of unpaid
OL,10,Fwork.
